<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <title>Восстановление пароля на сайте ShovdanYist</title>
        <style type="text/css">
            .md-notification-template {
                font-family: -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Open Sans,Helvetica Neue,"Noto Sans Armenian","Noto Sans Bengali","Noto Sans Cherokee","Noto Sans Devanagari","Noto Sans Ethiopic","Noto Sans Georgian","Noto Sans Hebrew","Noto Sans Kannada","Noto Sans Khmer","Noto Sans Lao","Noto Sans Osmanya","Noto Sans Tamil","Noto Sans Telugu","Noto Sans Thai",sans-serif;
                width: 100%;
                padding-top: 30px;
                background-color: #fff;
                border-radius: 5px;
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            .md-notify-box {
                width: 500px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                padding: 20px;
                border-radius: 5px;
                box-shadow: 0 1px 0 0 #d7d8db,0 0 0 1px #e3e4e8;
            }

            .md-notify-box img {
                width: 280px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                display: table;
            }

            .btn {
                padding: 10px;
                border-radius: 3px;
                color: #fff;
                text-decoration: unset;
            }

            .btn-blue {
                background-color: #3498db;
            }

            .btn:hover {
                opacity: 0.9;
            }

            table {
                margin: 0 auto;
            }

            table a {
                color: #fff !important;
                text-decoration: unset;
            }
            .md-email-info {
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #999;
                padding-top: 14px;
            }
            .md-email-info a {
                text-decoration: unset;
            }
        </style>
    </head>

    <body>

        <div class="md-notification-template">

            <div class="md-notify-box">

                <img src="https://shovdanyist.com/assets/images/logotype.png" alt="ShovdanYist Logotype">

                <br>
                Здравствуйте,
                <br><br>
                Чтобы восстановить пароль перейдите по ссылке и введите свой новый пароль
                <br><br>

                <table>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="btn btn-blue">
                                <a href="{{absolute_url(path('app_new_password', {'id': user.id, 'token': user.token}))}}">Восстановить пароль</a>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>

                <p class="md-email-info">
                        © ShovdanYist Inc. 32 bd Gambetta, Nice, AMCA 06000
                    <br><br>
                        This message was sent to {{ user.email }} and intended to recover the password of <a href="{{ path('user_profile', {'username': user.username}) }}">{{ user.username }}</a>.
                    <br><br>
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </body>

</html>
